#: title.txt:1
#, max-length:30
msgctxt "title.txt:1"
msgid "Aura Music"
msgstr "ஆரா இசை"

#: short_description.txt:1
#, max-length:80
msgctxt "short_description.txt:1"
msgid "Aura Music - Open source music player for YouTube Music"
msgstr ""
"ஆரா மியூசிக் - யூடியூப் மியூசிக்கிற்கான ஓப்பன் சோர்ச் மியூசிக் பிளேயர்"

#: full_description.txt:1
#, max-length:4000
msgctxt "full_description.txt:1"
msgid ""
"Aura Music is an open-source music player that lets you stream music directly from YouTube Music.\n"
"\n"
"Features:\n"
"- Stream music from YouTube Music\n"
"- Video playback support\n"
"- Lyrics display and translation\n"
"- Audio quality settings\n"
"- Background playback\n"
"- Queue management\n"
"- Search functionality\n"
"- Artist and album browsing\n"
"\n"
"This is the FOSS (Free and Open Source) version, compatible with F-Droid. It does not include Google Play Services dependencies.\n"
"\n"
"License: GPL-3.0"
msgstr ""
"Aura Music is an open-source music player that lets you stream music directly இருந்து YouTube Music.\n"
"\n"
"Features:\n"
"- Stream music இருந்து YouTube Music\n"
"- Video playback support\n"
"- Lyrics காட்சி and translation\n"
"- Audio quality settings\n"
"- பின்னணி playback\n"
"- Queue management\n"
"- தேடல் functionality\n"
"- Artist and album browsing\n"
"\n"
"This is the FOSS (Free and Open Source) version, compatible with F-Droid. It does not include Google Play சேவைகள் dependencies.\n"
"\n"
"License: GPL-3.0"

#: changelogs/10.txt:1
#, max-length:500
msgctxt "changelogs/10.txt:1"
msgid ""
"- Initial F-Droid release\n"
"- Video playback support\n"
"- Lyrics display and translation\n"
"- Stream music from YouTube Music"
msgstr ""
"- ஆரம்ப F-Droid வெளியீடு \n"
"- வீடியோ பின்னணி உதவி \n"
"- பாடல் வரிகள் காட்சி மற்றும் மொழிபெயர்ப்பு \n"
"- YouTube Music இலிருந்து இசையை ச்ட்ரீம் செய்யவும்"

